==============================================================================
Third-party code in this package
==============================================================================

DS Bot (DeepSeek-Bot)
Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright 2026 Fei2411 and the DS Bot contributors

  - src/client/characters.ts copies the character table of
    ds-bot/src/client/characters.js (the body, paint and shade paths and the eye
    capsules of each character) and adapts its look-from-id hashing and markup,
    and the light inks of ds-bot/src/client/inks.js.
  - src/client/mark.tsx adapts ds-bot/src/client/mark.js (BotMark: the states,
    the fidgets and their moments, the settle squash and the badges), and the
    mark styles in src/client/client.css adapt the matching rules and keyframes
    of ds-bot/src/client/styles.js.
  - src/app/step-approvals.ts follows the approval answerer of
    ds-bot/src/host/approvals.js (answering ahead of DSH with prepend), and its
    doingOf follows ds-bot/src/host/turns.js.
  - src/client/composer.tsx adapts ds-bot/src/client/composer.js and voice.js
    (one rounded row of "+", the draft, dictation and the voice/send button; voice
    chat that listens, sends, reads the answer aloud and listens again), and the
    composer styles in src/client/client.css adapt the matching rules of
    ds-bot/src/client/styles.js.
  - src/app/feed.ts follows the live feed of ds-bot/src/host/feed.js (a
    Server-Sent Events stream of what changed, kept open by a comment line, read
    again by the page).
  - src/client/flow-card.tsx follows the handoff card of
    ds-bot/src/client/handoff-card.js (a tool call in the chat drawn as a card
    that follows its state live).

  The paths above are relative to dev/ (the plugin's source workspace); lib/
  bundles them. tests/notice.spec.ts checks that every source file naming a
  ds-bot/src/ file is listed here.

